OL,3,GNEWSABridges open up woodland to
OL,4,Aroaming bison
OL,5,
OL,6,FBridges have opened in woodland near
OL,7,FCanterbury, doubling the area available
OL,8,Fto a herd of free-roaming European
OL,9,Fbison in Kent.
OL,11,FThe two crossings, in West Blean and
OL,12,FThornden Woods, allow the animals to
OL,13,Faccess an additional 50 hectares of
OL,14,Fhabitat, increasing their roaming area
OL,15,Fto 100 hectares.
OL,17,FKent Wildlife Trust said camera footage
OL,18,Fhad captured the herd using the bridges
OL,19,Ffor the first time as they began
OL,20,Fexploring areas of woodland that were
OL,21,Fpreviously inaccessible to them.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
